      "name_zh": "45度斜凳侧屈",
      "aliases": [],
      "body_part": "核心",
      "equipment": "自重",
      "target": "abs",
      "measurement": "reps",
      "instructions_zh": [
        "侧身支撑在45度斜凳上，外侧髋及上大腿靠垫，脚踏稳底板并用滚垫固定踝部，双手轻放头后。",
        "保持双腿、骨盆和脚部支点稳定，在身体侧向平面缓慢降低躯干，胸部仍朝前，不转成俯身或扭腰。",
        "用侧腹控制躯干回到高位，再完成同侧次数后换侧；避免拉扯头颈。"
      ],
      "instructions_en": [
        "Set up sideways on a 45-degree Roman chair with the outer hip and upper thigh supported, feet on the plate and ankles secured by the rollers; rest both hands lightly behind the head.",
        "Keep the legs, pelvis and foot supports steady while lowering the trunk in the lateral plane, keeping the chest facing forward rather than twisting or folding forward.",
        "Use the side of the trunk to return to the upper position; finish the repetitions before changing sides, without pulling on the neck."
      ],
