      "target": "pectorals",
      "measurement": "reps",
      "instructions_zh": [
        "仰卧平凳，头背臀有支撑，双脚踩稳地面；双手正握杠铃，双臂近直持于髋部前上方。",
        "保持身体和凳位固定，通过肩部抬杆经过胸部上方，握距与肘部轻微弯曲保持稳定。",
        "继续控制双臂向头后转动，再沿相反路径经过胸上方回到髋前；不站起或用躯干借力。"
      ],
      "instructions_en": [
        "Lie on a flat bench with the head, back and hips supported and both feet planted, holding the bar just above the hips with an overhand grip and nearly straight arms.",
        "Keep the body and bench fixed as you raise the bar through the shoulders to pass above the chest, maintaining the same grip width and soft elbow bend.",
        "Continue the controlled arc behind the head, then reverse through the chest-above position to the hips without standing or using torso momentum."
      ],
