      "target": null,
      "measurement": "reps",
      "instructions_zh": [
        "仰卧，屈髋抬起双腿，膝盖约成直角，小腿接近水平；双臂近伸直持片于胸上方。",
        "保持骨盆、下背和双腿稳定，卷起头肩及肩胛骨，让双手持片随上背向上前方移动。",
        "控制上背回落，保持抬腿姿势和握片稳定，避免坐起或摆腿借力。"
      ],
      "instructions_en": [
        "Lie supine with the hips and knees bent about ninety degrees and shins near horizontal, holding a plate above the chest with nearly straight arms.",
        "Keep the pelvis, low back and legs steady while curling the head, shoulders and shoulder blades up, moving the plate upward and forward with the upper trunk.",
        "Lower the upper back under control while maintaining the tabletop legs and a secure grip, without sitting up or swinging the legs."
      ],
