      "id": "ex-1437",
      "name_zh": "单臂哑铃手指弯举",
      "aliases": [],
      "body_part": "小臂",
      "equipment": "哑铃",
      "target": "forearms",
      "measurement": "reps",
      "instructions_zh": [
        "坐凳、双脚踩地，将工作侧前臂靠在大腿上，掌心向上，另一手扶腿。",
        "保持前臂支撑，让铃柄受控移至手指处，再收拢手指把它握回掌中。",
        "在可控的小幅范围内重复，避免抬前臂代偿，完成后换侧。"
      ],
      "instructions_en": [
        "Sit with both feet planted, support the working forearm on the thigh with the palm facing up, and rest the other hand on the opposite thigh.",
        "Keep the forearm supported, allow the handle to move toward the fingers under control, then close the fingers to draw it back into the palm.",
        "Repeat through a small controlled range without lifting the forearm, then switch sides."
      ],
