      "target": "biceps",
      "measurement": "reps",
      "instructions_zh": [
        "坐在凳上，双脚分开踩稳地面，身体稍前倾；工作臂靠同侧大腿内侧，掌心向上握低位滑轮单柄。",
        "保持工作肘的支撑和躯干稳定，屈肘将手柄弯举至肩前，另一手扶另一侧大腿。",
        "受控伸肘放回低位，保持上臂支撑，不用躯干摆动带动手柄。"
      ],
      "instructions_en": [
        "Sit on the bench with the feet planted apart and lean slightly forward. Brace the working upper arm against the inner thigh and take an underhand grip on the low-pulley handle.",
        "Keep the elbow supported and the torso steady as you curl the handle toward the shoulder, resting the free hand on the other thigh.",
        "Extend the elbow under control to return the handle to the low position without swinging the torso or lifting the upper arm away from its support."
      ],
